1
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:22,200
Grimbold, how many?

2
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:25,600
Five hundred men from the Westfold, my lord.

3
00:00:25,720 --> 00:00:28,960
Three hundred more from
Fenmarch, King Théoden.

4
00:00:29,360 --> 00:00:31,280
And the riders from Snowbourn?

5
00:00:31,480 --> 00:00:33,520
None have come, my lord.

6
00:00:50,400 --> 00:00:52,200
Six thousand spears.

7
00:00:53,400 --> 00:00:55,720
Less than half of what I'd hoped for.

8
00:00:55,840 --> 00:00:59,440
Six thousand will not be enough
to break the lines of Mordor.

9
00:01:01,920 --> 00:01:03,280
More will come.

10
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:07,080
Every hour lost hastens Gondor's defeat.

11
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:10,400
We have till dawn. Then we must ride.
